  "observations": [
    "Parent status, child identity, Daily Allowance versus one-time mode, positive whole-minute guidance and 1/5/10-minute presets are clear. Lavender focus outline is visible; primary fields and button faces are generous and fit narrow columns without overlap.",
    "All five Parent states were inspected at 390x844, 768x1024, 1024x768 and 1440x1000 through their native card PNGs. Parent top screenshots confirm responsive phone navigation, tablet horizontal navigation and desktop side navigation.",
    "Daily recurrence copy states 7 AM, family timezone, first library use, no carryover, and Parent stop/pause persistence. Explicit Allow access in stopped state and Add 5 minutes today in exhausted state give distinguishable recovery paths.",
    "Child exhausted and Parent-stopped messages use calm navy surfaces, readable large headings and different next-step copy. Choose profile is clearly visible. Four active Child anchors show Daily time · 1 min left above library content.",
    "Typography, rounded controls, restrained line icons and lavender/coral palette are coherent. No material clipping or horizontal overflow was observed in the supplied timer cards."
  ],
  "material_defects": [
    {
      "id": "J5-M1",
      "severity": "material",
      "area": "Parent immediate control placement and efficiency",
      "finding": "Pause, Resume, End now and recovery controls are below the entire mode/minutes/presets/explanatory setup stack. None appears in the initial Parent viewport at any supplied anchor, even when an active or paused timer is the reason for visiting Time controls.",
      "evidence": [
        "390 active-top shows only header, mode, custom field and presets at viewport bottom; active-card places End now around card y750 and Pause around y862. With the card starting around page y386, these are approximately page y1136 and y1248 in an 844px viewport.",
        "768 active-top has a card beginning around page y400 and no immediate controls in 1024px height; active-card places End now around card y753 and Pause around y865.",
        "1024 active-top has a card beginning around page y400; active-card puts End now around y660 and Pause around y718 within the card, beyond the 768px first viewport.",
        "1440 active-top shows Save allowance at the bottom; active-card puts End now around card y660, approximately page y1008, and Pause lower still. Paused cards similarly bury Resume; blocked cards bury Allow access."
      ],
      "impact": "Routine stop/pause/resume/recovery requires scrolling past editing controls and repeated policy copy. The time-sensitive management action is subordinate to settings at every target device, which materially fails Parent efficiency and action placement.",
      "acceptance": "Put the current session status and its immediate state-appropriate actions together near the top of each child card, before the settings form, or provide an equally direct accessible control surface. Reinspect actual rendered Parent views at all four anchors."
    }
  ],
  "optional_improvements": [
    "Replace the machine-shaped America/New_York display with a familiar New York label while retaining exact timezone meaning.",
    "Consolidate repeated recurrence and timing explanations after protecting the important distinctions; this can reduce card height.",
    "On Child exhaustion, brief explicit 'Ask your Parent for more time' guidance could improve recovery comprehension alongside Choose profile and existing Ask Parent navigation."
  ],
